@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Tarification & Promotions";
    Layout = "_SuperAdminLayout";
}

@* Module Tarification, Réductions & Offres Promotionnelles — consomme GET/POST /api/v1/admin/promo-codes
   (PromoCodesController). Les fenêtres de cette console utilisent <modal-shell theme="dark"> : même fenêtre en verre
   dépoli que le reste de l'application, palette sombre (la console est TOUJOURS sombre, voir le commentaire de tête de
   _SuperAdminLayout.cshtml). <select-field> reste en thème clair (bg-white, text-gray-900) : d'où les <select> natifs ici. *@
<div x-data="superAdminPricing()" x-init="load()" class="space-y-6">

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
            <h1 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Tarification &amp; Promotions</h1>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 mt-1">Codes promo, réductions et offres spéciales.</p>
        </div>
        <button type="button" x-on:click="openCreate()"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-sky-500 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-sky-400 transition-colors">
            <icon name="plus" class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:rotate-90" />
            Nouveau code
        </button>
    </div>

    <div x-show="error" x-cloak class="rounded-2xl border border-rose-500/30 bg-rose-500/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-rose-300" x-text="error"></div>

    @* Grille tarifaire par tranche d'effectif — GET/PUT /api/v1/admin/pricing-grid (AdminPricingGridController).
       Un nouveau prix s'applique aux NOUVELLES demandes et aux prochains paiements ; ce que le client voit sur
       le formulaire d'inscription vient de la même table (GET /api/v1/public/pricing-grid). *@
    <section class="space-y-3">
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Grille tarifaire par effectif</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 mt-1">
                Prix publiés sur le formulaire d'inscription, en FCFA. Au-delà de
                <span x-text="quoteAboveStudents"></span> élèves : offre « Grand Groupe », sur devis.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div x-show="gridError" x-cloak class="rounded-2xl border border-rose-500/30 bg-rose-500/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-rose-300" x-text="gridError"></div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/60 backdrop-blur overflow-hidden">
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse">
                    <thead>
                        <tr class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 border-b border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/40">
                            <th class="py-3 px-4 font-medium">Tranche</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-4 font-medium">Mensuel</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-4 font-medium">Annuel</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-4 font-medium">Majoration Internat</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-4 font-medium">Dernière modification</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-right">Actions</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody class="divide-y divide-zinc-800/80">
                        <tr x-show="!gridLoading && grid.length === 0" x-cloak>
                            <td colspan="6" class="py-8 text-center text-sm text-zinc-500">Aucun tarif configuré.</td>
                        </tr>
                        <template x-for="row in grid" :key="row.price.tier">
                            <tr class="hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors">
                                <td class="py-3 px-4">
                                    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-100" x-text="tierLabel(row.price)"></p>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500" x-text="'tolérance jusqu\'à ' + row.price.softLimit"></p>
                                </td>
                                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-zinc-100 whitespace-nowrap" x-text="formatXof(row.price.monthlyXof)"></td>
                                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-zinc-100 whitespace-nowrap">
                                    <span x-text="formatXof(row.price.annualXof)"></span>
                                    <span class="block text-xs text-zinc-500" x-text="paidMonthsLabel(row.price)"></span>
                                </td>
                                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-zinc-400 whitespace-nowrap" x-text="surchargeLabel(row.price)"></td>
                                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-xs text-zinc-500" x-text="row.updatedAt ? formatDate(row.updatedAt) : 'Grille de départ'"></td>
                                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">
                                    <button type="button" x-on:click="openPriceEdit(row)"
                                            class="text-xs font-medium text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300 px-1.5 py-1">Modifier</button>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </template>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- KPI -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/60 p-5 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
            <div class="min-w-0">
                <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500">Codes actifs</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-black text-emerald-400" x-text="activeCodes.length"></p>
            </div>
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 ml-3">
                <icon name="checkmark-circle" class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" />
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/60 p-5 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
            <div class="min-w-0">
                <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500">Codes expirés/désactivés</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-black text-zinc-400" x-text="promoCodes.length - activeCodes.length"></p>
            </div>
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 ml-3">
                <icon name="block" class="w-5 h-5 text-zinc-400" />
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/60 p-5 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
            <div class="min-w-0">
                <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500">Utilisations totales</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-black text-sky-400" x-text="totalUses"></p>
            </div>
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-sky-500/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 ml-3">
                <icon name="chart-multiple" class="w-5 h-5 text-sky-400" />
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/60 p-5 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
            <div class="min-w-0">
                <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500">Écoles bénéficiaires</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-black text-white" x-text="totalBeneficiarySchools"></p>
            </div>
            <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-violet-500/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 ml-3">
                <icon name="building" class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-400" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Table (≥ sm) -->
    <div class="hidden sm:block rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/60 backdrop-blur overflow-hidden">
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse">
                <thead>
                    <tr class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 border-b border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/40">
                        <th class="py-3 px-4 font-medium">Code</th>
                        <th class="py-3 px-4 font-medium">Type</th>
                        <th class="py-3 px-4 font-medium">Valeur</th>
                        <th class="py-3 px-4 font-medium">Validité</th>
                        <th class="py-3 px-4 font-medium">Utilisations</th>
                        <th class="py-3 px-4 font-medium">Écoles bénéficiaires</th>
                        <th class="py-3 px-4 font-medium">Statut</th>
                        <th class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-right">Actions</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody class="divide-y divide-zinc-800/80">
                    <template x-if="isLoading">
                        <template x-for="i in 4" :key="i">
                            <tr><td class="py-3 px-4" colspan="8"><div class="h-4 w-full rounded-xl bg-zinc-800 animate-pulse"></div></td></tr>
                        </template>
                    </template>

                    <tr x-show="!isLoading && promoCodes.length === 0" x-cloak>
                        <td colspan="8" class="py-12 text-center text-sm text-zinc-500">Aucun code promo pour le moment.</td>
                    </tr>

                    <template x-for="code in promoCodes" :key="code.id">
                        <tr class="hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors">
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 font-mono text-sm font-medium text-zinc-100" x-text="code.code"></td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-zinc-400" x-text="discountTypeLabel(code.discountType)"></td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-zinc-400" x-text="valueLabel(code)"></td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-zinc-400 whitespace-nowrap" x-text="formatDate(code.startDateUtc) + ' → ' + formatDate(code.endDateUtc)"></td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-zinc-400" x-text="code.currentUses + (code.maxUses ? ' / ' + code.maxUses : '')"></td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-zinc-400" x-text="code.beneficiarySchoolNames.length ? code.beneficiarySchoolNames.join(', ') : '—'"></td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4">
                                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium" :class="statusClasses(code)" x-text="statusLabel(code)"></span>
                            </td>
                            <td class="py-3 px-4 text-right whitespace-nowrap">
                                <button type="button" x-show="code.isActive" x-cloak
                                        x-on:click="openDeactivate(code)" :disabled="deactivatingId === code.id"
                                        class="text-xs font-medium text-rose-400 hover:text-rose-300 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-wait px-1.5 py-1">
                                    <span x-text="deactivatingId === code.id ? 'Désactivation…' : 'Désactiver'"></span>
                                </button>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </template>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Cartes (< sm) -->
    <div class="sm:hidden space-y-3">
        <template x-for="code in promoCodes" :key="code.id">
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/60 p-6">
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
                    <p class="font-mono font-medium text-zinc-100 truncate" x-text="code.code"></p>
                    <span class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium" :class="statusClasses(code)" x-text="statusLabel(code)"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-zinc-500">
                    <span x-text="discountTypeLabel(code.discountType) + ' — ' + valueLabel(code)"></span>
                    <span x-text="code.currentUses + (code.maxUses ? ' / ' + code.maxUses : '')"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </template>
    </div>

    @* Édition d'un prix de tranche — même gabarit dark que le formulaire de création ci-dessous. *@
    <div x-show="priceEdit" x-cloak
         class="fixed inset-0 z-40 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm px-4"
         x-on:keydown.escape.window="closePriceEdit()">
        <div class="w-full max-w-lg rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 p-6 shadow-xl max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto">
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-white" x-text="priceEdit ? 'Tarif — ' + tierLabel(priceEdit.price) : ''"></h2>

            <div x-show="priceErrors.global" x-cloak class="mt-3 rounded-2xl border border-rose-500/30 bg-rose-500/10 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-rose-300" x-text="priceErrors.global"></div>

            <form x-on:submit.prevent="submitPriceEdit()" novalidate class="mt-4 space-y-4">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                    <div>
                        <label class="form-label-inverse">Mensuel (FCFA)</label>
                        <input type="number" min="1" step="1" x-model.number="priceDraft.monthlyXof"
                               class="w-full rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-zinc-100 focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500" />
                        <p x-show="priceErrors.monthlyxof" x-text="priceErrors.monthlyxof" class="mt-1 text-xs text-rose-400"></p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="form-label-inverse">Annuel (FCFA)</label>
                        <input type="number" min="1" step="1" x-model.number="priceDraft.annualXof"
                               class="w-full rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-zinc-100 focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500" />
                        <p x-show="priceErrors.annualxof" x-text="priceErrors.annualxof" class="mt-1 text-xs text-rose-400"></p>
                        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-500" x-text="paidMonthsLabel(priceDraft)"></p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <p class="text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400">Majoration si l'école a un Internat (0 = aucune)</p>
                    <div class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                        <div>
                            <label class="form-label-inverse">Par mois (FCFA)</label>
                            <input type="number" min="0" step="1" x-model.number="priceDraft.boardingSurchargeMonthlyXof"
                                   class="w-full rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-zinc-100 focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500" />
                            <p x-show="priceErrors.boardingsurchargemonthlyxof" x-text="priceErrors.boardingsurchargemonthlyxof" class="mt-1 text-xs text-rose-400"></p>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="form-label-inverse">Par an (FCFA)</label>
                            <input type="number" min="0" step="1" x-model.number="priceDraft.boardingSurchargeAnnualXof"
                                   class="w-full rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-zinc-100 focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500" />
                            <p x-show="priceErrors.boardingsurchargeannualxof" x-text="priceErrors.boardingsurchargeannualxof" class="mt-1 text-xs text-rose-400"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex justify-end gap-3 pt-2">
                    <button type="button" x-on:click="closePriceEdit()" :disabled="isSavingPrice"
                            class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-300 hover:bg-zinc-800 hover:text-white transition-colors disabled:opacity-50">
                        Annuler
                    </button>
                    <button type="submit" :disabled="isSavingPrice"
                            class="rounded-2xl bg-sky-500 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-sky-400 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50">
                        <span x-text="isSavingPrice ? 'Enregistrement…' : 'Enregistrer'"></span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    @* Formulaire de création — modal dark hand-roulé (voir commentaire de tête). *@
    <modal-shell open="isCreateOpen" on-close="closeCreate()" size="lg" theme="dark">
        <modal-title>Nouveau code promo</modal-title>
            <div x-show="createErrors.global" x-cloak class="rounded-2xl border border-rose-500/30 bg-rose-500/10 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-rose-300" x-text="createErrors.global"></div>

            <form x-on:submit.prevent="submitCreate()" novalidate class="mt-4 space-y-4">
                <div>
                    <label class="form-label-inverse">Code</label>
                    <input type="text" x-model="newCode.code" placeholder="BIENVENUE2026"
                           class="w-full rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-zinc-100 uppercase placeholder:text-zinc-600 focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500" />
                    <p x-show="createErrors.code" x-text="createErrors.code" class="mt-1 text-xs text-rose-400"></p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                    <div>
                        <label class="form-label-inverse">Type de remise</label>
                        <select x-model="newCode.discountType"
                                class="w-full rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-zinc-100 focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500 font-semibold">
                            <option value="Percentage" class="font-semibold">Pourcentage</option>
                            <option value="FixedAmount" class="font-semibold">Montant fixe (FCFA)</option>
                            <option value="FreeTrialMonths" class="font-semibold">Essai gratuit (mois)</option>
                            <option value="FullDiscount" class="font-semibold">Offert à 100 %</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div x-show="requiresValue" x-cloak>
                        <label class="form-label-inverse" x-text="newCode.discountType === 'Percentage' ? 'Valeur (%)' : 'Valeur (FCFA)'"></label>
                        <input type="number" min="0" step="0.01" x-model.number="newCode.discountValue"
                               class="w-full rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-zinc-100 focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500" />
                        <p x-show="createErrors.discountvalue" x-text="createErrors.discountvalue" class="mt-1 text-xs text-rose-400"></p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                    <div>
                        <label class="form-label-inverse">Durée (mois)</label>
                        <input type="number" min="1" x-model.number="newCode.durationMonths"
                               class="w-full rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-zinc-100 focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500" />
                        <p x-show="createErrors.durationmonths" x-text="createErrors.durationmonths" class="mt-1 text-xs text-rose-400"></p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="form-label-inverse">Limite d'utilisations</label>
                        <input type="number" min="1" x-model.number="newCode.maxUses" placeholder="Illimité"
                               class="w-full rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-zinc-100 placeholder:text-zinc-600 focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500" />
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                    <div>
                        <label class="form-label-inverse">Date de début</label>
                        <input type="date" x-model="newCode.startDate"
                               class="w-full rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-zinc-100 focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500" />
                        <p x-show="createErrors.startdateutc" x-text="createErrors.startdateutc" class="mt-1 text-xs text-rose-400"></p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="form-label-inverse">Date de fin</label>
                        <input type="date" x-model="newCode.endDate"
                               class="w-full rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-zinc-100 focus:border-sky-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500" />
                        <p x-show="createErrors.enddateutc" x-text="createErrors.enddateutc" class="mt-1 text-xs text-rose-400"></p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex justify-end gap-3 pt-2">
                    <button type="button" x-on:click="closeCreate()" :disabled="isSubmitting"
                            class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-300 hover:bg-zinc-800 hover:text-white transition-colors disabled:opacity-50">
                        Annuler
                    </button>
                    <button type="submit" :disabled="isSubmitting"
                            class="rounded-2xl bg-sky-500 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-sky-400 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50">
                        <span x-text="isSubmitting ? 'Création…' : 'Créer le code'"></span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>
    </modal-shell>

    @* Confirmation avant désactivation — même gabarit que « Infiltrer un établissement »
       (Schools.cshtml) : couper un code promo empêche immédiatement toute nouvelle souscription de
       s'en servir, une conséquence pas toujours voulue d'un simple clic mal placé dans un tableau. *@
    <modal-shell open="deactivateTarget" on-close="closeDeactivate()" size="md" theme="dark">
        <modal-title>Désactiver le code promo</modal-title>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">
                Le code <span class="font-mono font-medium text-zinc-100" x-text="deactivateTarget ? deactivateTarget.code : ''"></span>
                ne pourra plus être utilisé pour aucune nouvelle souscription. Les abonnements qui s'en
                servent déjà ne sont pas affectés.
            </p>

            <div x-show="deactivateError" x-cloak class="mt-3 rounded-2xl border border-rose-500/30 bg-rose-500/10 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-rose-300" x-text="deactivateError"></div>

            <div class="mt-6 flex justify-end gap-3 border-t border-zinc-800 pt-4">
                <button type="button" x-on:click="closeDeactivate()" :disabled="deactivatingId === (deactivateTarget && deactivateTarget.id)"
                        class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-300 hover:bg-zinc-800 hover:text-white transition-colors disabled:opacity-50">
                    Annuler
                </button>
                <button type="button" x-on:click="confirmDeactivate()" :disabled="deactivatingId === (deactivateTarget && deactivateTarget.id)"
                        class="rounded-2xl bg-rose-500 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-rose-400 transition-colors disabled:opacity-50">
                    <span x-text="deactivatingId === (deactivateTarget && deactivateTarget.id) ? 'Désactivation…' : 'Désactiver'"></span>
                </button>
            </div>
    </modal-shell>
</div>

@section Scripts {
    <script src="~/js/superadmin-pricing.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
}
